Z||000000||dogtired||11-05-1999||05:21 PM||||I posted this to another Fiero List & had relative good success so thought I would do it here.   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> <P>AutoZone will give anyone that askes a FREE booklet that explains some of the computer codes our car will register and also give you a FREE key so you don't have to use a bent paperclip.<P>I realize that some towns do not have AutoZones. I have several of these booklets and keys and the clerk there said I could have all I wanted. FREE<P>Can YOU not get one?  Do YOU want one?<P>For the cost of the envelope and postage you can have one, Just E-Mail me off list and give me your address. So far it has cost about $1 buck for each I have sent out except for the ones I sent to the Netherlands, and Canada. <BR>I am in no way associated with AutoZone and I am not making any money off this offer. I am just doing it as a supporter of our FIERO's.<BR>||||reg||10
